      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devens%2C_Massachusetts",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "After closure, MassDevelopment bought most former base land for $17 million and is turning it into a residential and business community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
