      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devens%2C_Massachusetts",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A former Army base now hosts a Federal Medical Center prison hospital, established by the Bureau of Prisons.",
